						<text class="demo-col-label">offset=8 + pull=4 · 左移回 4</text>
						<vx-row :gutter="12">
							<vx-col :span="8" :offset="8" :pull="4">
								<view class="demo-col-box demo-col-box--soft">
									<text class="demo-col-box__text demo-col-box__text--soft">8 · pull 4</text>
								</view>
							</vx-col>
						</vx-row>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">同时传 push 和 pull 取净值；位移不改变占位，后面的列不会跟着挪。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="隐藏" desc="三列里中间那列写 span=0：这一档不显示，但仍留在页面里。" />
					<view class="demo-col-stage">
						<vx-row :gutter="12">
							<vx-col :span="8">
								<view class="demo-col-box">
